    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/47afc16f62b8b0881c2a66f2f5db08db.poster.avif?t=1726465840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/47afc16f62b8b0881c2a66f2f5db08db.webm?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/47afc16f62b8b0881c2a66f2f5db08db.mp4?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/c755ba84010a4f4a24d9b27bdc1b7095.webp?t=1726465840\" /></span><br><br>Atlantis is being razed! Demon hordes have burst through dimensional gates to destroy the entire continent. The last Atlantean refugees have been devoured by a sea abomination as they boarded their ships to flee the massacre. In this game excerpt, the monsters appear to be led by a mysterious enemy: cunning General Kipak.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/8d63f9647be52205ced688997668a6cf.poster.avif?t=1726465840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/8d63f9647be52205ced688997668a6cf.webm?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/8d63f9647be52205ced688997668a6cf.mp4?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What is happening in the once mighty Atlantis? The heroes land on a dangerous beach, each with a powerful reason for being there...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/c755ba84010a4f4a24d9b27bdc1b7095.webp?t=1726465840\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/08dd740a98c19f35f5a997741315e18f.poster.avif?t=1726465840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/08dd740a98c19f35f5a997741315e18f.webm?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358610/extras/08dd740a98c19f35f5a997741315e18f.mp4?t=1726465840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relive the glory of arcades in this action platformer for up to 4 players. This game excerpt contains:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 distinct levels of increasing difficulty (from the more than 50 stages that the complete game will have), riddled with enemies, traps and challenges.<br></li><li>The beginning of Abathor's story. You will start to sense what is happening on the Atlantis continent and how to deal with the threat.<br></li><li>A combat against the sea abomination that has devoured the fleeing Atlanteans.<br></li><li>A pixel-perfect art design, beautiful and detailed, and epic musical compositions.</li></ul>",
